{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your reason beneath the falling cherry blossoms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yurina embarks on a journey through a fleeting world painted in petals, seeking the answer to a single question: <i>Why do I Duel?</i> <br>In a land where  <i>Mikoto</i>\u00a0channel divine power to duel beneath blooming sakura trees, destiny is written in steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sakura-blade duels and divine trials await.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced 2D side-scrolling action game that blends intense combat, precise platforming, and rhythmic parries.<br>Engage in elegant, high-speed duels and carve your path through a vibrant pixel art world steeped in Eastern mystique.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894600?t=1768854627","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/7f537944264775533d4d41f74a029b3204fa7e97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768854627","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/b5b21b417b2dc945e9d82536d9e83a4d0163e4ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768854627","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894600/b5b21b417b2dc945e9d82536d9e83a4d0163e4ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768854627","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your reason beneath the falling cherry blossoms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yurina embarks on a journey through a fleeting world painted in petals, seeking the answer to a singl